// THE ONE-ARMED VETERAN (Corey, 2026-10-08) - he stands on the Wilderness line north of Edgeville and has
// nothing to sell. He is the one who tells you what the Undertaker is for.
//
// HIS ARM IS ACTUALLY GONE, not implied by his name. A *_manwear2 model is the pair of sleeves,
// symmetric about the body's middle, so every face lying wholly on one side of it was dropped; the
// platebody's pauldron on that side went with it, because with the pauldron left on a 377 figure
// reads as a man standing square on and the missing arm cannot be seen at all. The faces that
// straddle the middle are kept, so the chest is whole.
//
// Tinted one part at a time, like the Undertaker, so the walk and ready animations still have the
// vertex labels they deform (a merged figure has none and slides about in a T-pose).
//
// THE CHATHEAD IS ITS OWN SET OF MODELS, and an npc with no head1 that is a face has no chathead at
// all - the dialogue box opens on nothing. head1..headN are merged the way model1..modelN are, so a
// talking human needs the FACE model, then whatever he is wearing on it, then his jaw. all.idk
// states which chathead goes with which body head: man_head_shorthair pairs the body's
// obj_viking_helmet_manwear with the chathead obj_pickpocket_guide_man, so those two always travel
// together.
//
// HIS FACE IS THE CACHE'S, UNTOUCHED. model1 was once npc_veteran_helm, a tinted copy of
// obj_viking_helmet_manwear - taken for a helmet because of the name. It is not a helmet; it is the
// short-haired man's head, and tinting it hue 0 sat 1 turned a living man grey. He is a veteran,
// not a corpse.
[wilderness_veteran]
name=One-armed veteran
desc=He has been to the places you are about to go.
model1=obj_viking_helmet_manwear
model2=idk_42
model3=idk_man_jaw_short
model4=npc_veteran_body
model5=npc_veteran_arm
model6=npc_veteran_legs
model7=npc_veteran_cape
model8=npc_veteran_boots
head1=obj_pickpocket_guide_man
head2=idk_man_jaw_short_head
readyanim=human_ready
walkanim=human_walk_f,human_walk_b,human_walk_l,human_walk_r
vislevel=hide
wanderrange=0
op1=Talk-to
